# Market and Localization

- Genezisi is a founder-led bespoke studio offering websites, AI systems and automation.
- No fixed website packages and no new digital-card sales. Existing customers and domains remain supported.
- The studio is based in Georgia and can work remotely. Do not invent foreign offices or claim unsupported geographic coverage.
- The homepage has English, Georgian and Belgian-Dutch editions. Other legacy routes may not have equivalent translations; check the actual content before adding hreflang.
- Respect Georgian language quality: ask for human review of substantive public Georgian commercial copy where possible.
- Design mobile-first but do not cite unsourced market-share statistics.
- WhatsApp is an existing contact channel, not proof that every customer prefers it.
